<details class="plan-chapter" id="project-detail-7"><summary><span class="chapter-count">07</span><h3>Your questions, answered</h3>
<span aria-hidden="true" class="chapter-toggle">+</span></summary><div class="chapter-body prose"><details class="faq-item"><summary>What makes a good patio design?</summary><div>


									A good patio design balances durability, functionality, and aesthetics. It should match your home’s style while also handling local weather conditions like freeze-thaw cycles in Colorado. Proper drainage, smart layout planning, and choosing the right materials—such as pavers, stone, or concrete—are key. A well-designed patio also considers how you’ll use the space, whether for dining, relaxing, or entertaining.								

</div>
</details>

<details class="faq-item"><summary>How much should a 20x20 patio cost?</summary><div>


									A 20×20 patio typically costs anywhere from $3,000 to $12,000+, depending on materials, design complexity, and site conditions. Basic concrete is usually more affordable, while high-end paver or natural stone patios increase the price. Labor, excavation, and drainage work can also significantly affect the final cost.								

</div>
</details>

<details class="faq-item"><summary>How to make your patio look expensive?</summary><div>
<div id="elementor-tab-content-2023"><p>To make a patio look high-end, focus on quality materials like natural stone or premium pavers, add layered lighting, and incorporate built-in features such as seating or fire pits. Clean design lines, minimal clutter, and well-planned landscaping also elevate the overall look without needing a huge budget.</p>
</div>

</div>
</details>

<details class="faq-item"><summary>What are the latest patio design trends?</summary><div>


									Modern patio trends include outdoor living rooms, fire features, multi-level layouts, and mixed-material designs. Homeowners are also adding built-in seating, LED lighting, and eco-friendly landscaping. In Colorado, weather-resistant and low-maintenance designs are especially popular.								

</div>
</details>
</div>
